# Quantumult X remote filter - ChatGPT / OpenAI
# Updated: 2026-11-08
# Policy: GPT (keep your existing Quantumult X policy group / remote URL)
# Sources:
#   OpenAI network requirements:
#   https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps
#   Community cross-check: blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script, TannayeJ/ai-vendor-rules,
#   kiki0-zz/QX_rules, storevip/Quantumult-X-Rules
# Covers ChatGPT iOS/web, Codex streaming/WebSocket, login, assets, upload,
# historical Azure CDN, real-time Azure Web PubSub and LiveKit voice endpoints.
# Routing rules are not a WebSocket keepalive or a guarantee of node reliability.
#
# 1. OpenAI-owned and product domains (includes ws.chatgpt.com / ios.chat.openai.com)
host-suffix, chatgpt.com, GPT
host-suffix, openai.com, GPT
host-suffix, oaistatic.com, GPT
host-suffix, oaiusercontent.com, GPT
host-suffix, oaistatsig.com, GPT
host-suffix, chat.com, GPT
host-suffix, sora.com, GPT
host-suffix, chatgpt.site, GPT

# 2. OpenAI-specific content/CDN and Azure real-time backends
host, cdn.openaimerge.com, GPT
host, openaiassets.blob.core.windows.net, GPT
host, openaicom-api-bdcpf8c6d2e9atf6.z01.azurefd.net, GPT
host, openaicomproductionae4b.blob.core.windows.net, GPT
host, production-openaicom-storage.azureedge.net, GPT
host-suffix, openaiapi-site.azureedge.net, GPT
host-suffix, openaicom.imgix.net, GPT
host-suffix, openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net, GPT
# Narrow keyword: specifically OpenAI's named Azure Web PubSub instances,
# not the entire shared webpubsub.azure.com domain.
host-keyword, chatgpt-async-webps-prod, GPT

# 3. Authentication and challenge (exact shared-service hosts only)
host, cdn.workos.com, GPT
host, forwarder.workos.com, GPT
host, frontend-apps-multi-region.workos.com, GPT
host, setup.workos.com, GPT
host, images.workoscdn.com, GPT
host, workos.imgix.net, GPT
host, challenges.cloudflare.com, GPT
host, openai-api.arkoselabs.com, GPT
host, client-api.arkoselabs.com, GPT

# 4. Feature configuration and real-time voice
host, api.statsig.com, GPT
host, events.statsigapi.net, GPT
host-suffix, featuregates.org, GPT
host-suffix, chatgpt.livekit.cloud, GPT
host-suffix, host.livekit.cloud, GPT
host-suffix, turn.livekit.cloud, GPT

# 5. Exact auxiliary hosts from OpenAI's official network list
# Shared third-party hosts may also be used by unrelated applications.
host, js.intercomcdn.com, GPT
host, js.stripe.com, GPT
host, o207216.ingest.sentry.io, GPT
host, o33249.ingest.sentry.io, GPT
host, rum.browser-intake-datadoghq.com, GPT

# Avoid routing entire shared platforms (auth0.com, stripe.com, sentry.io,
# intercom.io, Cloudflare CDN, Azure, Google, Apple and large ASN/IP ranges).
# The official allowlist also mentions ct.sendgrid.net and humb.apple.com,
# but they are intentionally not proxied here as they do not carry chat streams.
